BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:HBO
DESCRIPTION:It’s the season finale of Lanterns: The Official Podcast. Juju
  Green sits down with showrunner\, writer\, co-creator and executive prod
 ucer Chris Mundy\, co-creator\, writer and executive producer Damon Linde
 lof\, and co-creator\, writer and executive producer Tom King to break do
 wn Episode 8\, “Dirt and Stars.” \n\nThe conversation goes deep on John S
 tewart accepting the Green Lantern mantle\, Hal Jordan’s legacy\, the emo
 tional choices behind the finale\, the new Green Lantern oath\, Sinestro’
 s influence\, the John Stewart and Noah Macon relationship\, and the crea
 tive decisions that brought the season to a close.  \n\nThen\, Juju talks
  with Shea Pritchard\, who plays Noah Macon\, about stepping into the rol
 e\, working with Aaron Pierre and Kyle Chandler\, Noah’s biggest choices 
 in the finale\, and the nature-versus-nurture themes at the heart of his 
 character. Plus\, Ulrich Thomsen delivers one final message as Sinestro.
DTEND:20261005T024600Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T030002Z
DTSTART:20261005T015300Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:TENTATIVE
SUMMARY:Lanterns - 0x16 - Lanterns: The Official Podcast | Episode 8\, "Di
 rt and Stars"
UID:NzbDrone_episode_22106
END:VEVENT
